232
00:10:27,156 --> 00:10:28,546
Moxxie?

233
00:10:28,879 --> 00:10:30,128
W porządku?

234
00:10:31,669 --> 00:10:33,085
Odejdź!

235
00:10:33,086 --> 00:10:34,752
Moxxie, co się dzieje?

236
00:10:35,178 --> 00:10:37,178
Nic! To-

237
